12604, "like_count": 29, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "Global Central Bank Update:\n-Australia hiked rates for the 5th time this year, 25 bps move up to 4.85%. https://t.co/ii3GRtXAWo", "url": "https://x.com/charliebilello/status/2117710632028188900"}, {"author_id": "17469492", "created_at": "2026-11-03T20:01:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117708859254976945"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 206, "id": "212241934", "start": 192, "username": "JamesMLindsay"}], "urls": [{"description": "Even as votes for the midterms elections are being counted, eyes are turning to the 2028 presidential election.", "display_url": "cfr.org/articles/the-2…", "end": 231, "expanded_url": "https://www.cfr.org/articles/the-2028-presidential-race-is-about-to-begin?utm_medium=social_owned&utm_source=tw", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117702741497946112/6kDBsfR5?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117702741497946112/6kDBsfR5?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 208, "status": 200, "title": "The 2028 Presidential Race Is About to Begin | Council on Foreign Relations", "unwound_url": "https://www.cfr.org/articles/the-2028-presidential-race-is-about-to-begin?utm_medium=social_owned&utm_source=tw", "url": "https://t.co/jNfP5hVSmw"}]}, "id": "2117708859254976945", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1800, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Whatever the partisan alignment of Congress after the midterm elections today, \"the campaign to succeed President Donald Trump will hang over American politics for the next two years,\" writes @JamesMLindsay. https://t.co/jNfP5hVSmw", "url": "https://x.com/CFR_org/status/2117708859254976945"}, {"author_id": "272019676", "created_at": "2026-11-03T20:00:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117708447231664524"], "id": "2117708447231664524", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1497, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\"The Starshield service changes in Ukraine come at a time when leaders &amp; citizens of many longtime U.S. allies &amp; partners have questioned the value of their relationship with the U.S. While such concerns are not new, worries about the dependability of the U.S. as a partner are on", "url": "https://x.com/CSIS/status/2117708447231664524"}, {"author_id": "17469492", "created_at": "2026-11-03T19:54:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117707006094069909"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/b9rvo5jjVp", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/CFR_org/status/2117707006094069909/video/1", "media_key": "13_2117706689872834560", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/b9rvo5jjVp"}]}, "id": "2117707006094069909", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1840, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "“Americans in general, even in presidential elections, don’t necessarily say that foreign policy is a top, top issue. But what we all are seeing in our polling is the economy is a top issue—but this time, it’s pretty clear that the economy contains a lot of foreign policy in it https://t.co/b9rvo5jjVp", "url": "https://x.com/CFR_org/status/2117707006094069909"}, {"author_id": "17469492", "created_at": "2026-11-03T19:50:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117706068390256991"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "A guide to CFR’s analysis, polling, videos, and podcasts on voter priorities, the global issues on the ballot, and the stakes after November 3.", "display_url": "cfr.org/articles/forei…", "end": 221, "expanded_url": "https://www.cfr.org/articles/foreign-policy-and-the-2026-midterms-a-cfr-guide?utm_medium=social_owned&utm_source=tw", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117706072991444992/2umRMtSQ?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117706072991444992/2umRMtSQ?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 198, "status": 200, "title": "Foreign Policy and the 2026 Midterms: A CFR Guide | Council on Foreign Relations", "unwound_url": "https://www.cfr.org/articles/foreign-policy-and-the-2026-midterms-a-cfr-guide?utm_medium=social_owned&utm_source=tw", "url": "https://t.co/8f8ZtVdGAS"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/kwCJv2Z0wC", "end": 245, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/CFR_org/status/2117706068390256991/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117706065651408896", "start": 222, "url": "https://t.co/kwCJv2Z0wC"}]}, "id": "2117706068390256991", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1803, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "U.S. foreign policy issues could affect how people vote today—something our experts have been unpacking for months. Here’s a rundown of our midterm coverage as voters continue to head to the polls: https://t.co/8f8ZtVdGAS https://t.co/kwCJv2Z0wC", "url": "https://x.com/CFR_org/status/2117706068390256991"}, {"author_id": "1413027896", "created_at": "2026-11-03T19:38:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117702937099288830"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/charliebilello…", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/charliebilello/status/2117690708790559213", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/zShJef1ir4"}]}, "id": "2117702937099288830", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 14976, "like_count": 40, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 4}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117690708790559213", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Amazon Revenue (Billions)\n2026 (est): 829\n2025: 717\n2024: 638\n2023: 575\n2022: 514\n2021: 470\n2020: 386\n2019: 281\n2018: 233\n2017: 178\n2016: 136\n2015: 107\n2014: 89\n2013: 74\n2012: 61\n2011: 48\n2010: 34\n2009: 25\n2008: 19\n2007: 15\n2006: 11\n\n24% annuali